alue, as better hands (like a pair of 5s, 6s, or better 3s) will call or raise, and worse hands will likely fold. Betting might also expose me to a raise, forcing me to fold equity. By checking, I keep the pot small, control the risk, and give myself a chance to see the turn card for free or induce a bluff from the opponent later. Folding is irrational as there is no cost to check.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
